---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Valorferrum – SEO Freelancer & Performance Marketing Consultant"
  description="Performance Marketing Freelancer with agency and startup experience. No excess profit, only value-driven work. Specialized in SEO, SEA, Tracking & Web Development for SMEs, startups & NGOs."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">

      <!-- Hero: Image + Bio -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="aspect-square max-w-sm mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-spectrum-pink to-spectrum-blue p-1">
            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-2xl bg-surface flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-8xl font-display font-bold text-text-primary">V</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal space-y-6">
          <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary leading-tight">
            Freelancer SEO, SEA & Online Marketing Consultant
          </h1>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed">
            I am a Performance Marketing Freelancer with agency and startup experience. My focus: SMEs, startups and NGOs that want more than quick fixes.
          </p>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            My path began with a Bachelor's degree in Business Administration, led through a startup engagement after the founding phase and a shortened trainee position at an online marketing agency to three years as a permanent Online Marketing Manager. There, I managed Google Ads campaigns, developed from a tracking novice to the main contact for web analytics and reporting, organized SEO projects – and deepened my technical skills in HTML and JavaScript on the side.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary text-sm font-medium">SEO</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-spectrum-pink/10 text-spectrum-pink text-sm font-medium">SEA</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-spectrum-blue/10 text-spectrum-blue text-sm font-medium">Web Development</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-spectrum-yellow/10 text-spectrum-yellow text-sm font-medium">Tracking</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Why Valorferrum? -->
      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-6">Why Valorferrum?</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            I have seen how well digitalization can work – and where there is potential for a different approach. In agencies and companies, there are often rigid structures, separate departments and a logic that is not always in the best interest of the client.
          </p>
          <p>
            The decision to go self-employed came from the conviction that a leaner, more direct way of working works better for both sides: for me, because I bear full responsibility and have no internal friction losses. And for you, because you get a contact person who understands the entire stack – from the first line of code to the final conversion.
          </p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-text-primary">
            Without overhead. Without interface losses. Only value-driven work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- The Journey Here -->
      <div class="reveal mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-8">The Journey Here</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <span class="text-primary font-bold">1</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Foundations & Startup</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Bachelor's in Business Administration, then entry into a young startup after the founding phase. Supporting marketing activities – first practical experience with limited resources and fast decisions.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <span class="text-spectrum-pink font-bold">2</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Agency & Breadth</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Shortened trainee position at an online marketing agency, followed by three years as Online Marketing Manager. Main focus on Google Ads, web tracking and analytics. SEO was always the foundation of my successes: I planned, organized and supported SEO strategies – not as a main activity, but as the foundation on which all other channels build.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <span class="text-spectrum-blue font-bold">3</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Technical Depth</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
              For one and a half years, targeted development in HTML and JavaScript. Private web development projects that show: I understand not only marketing, but also the technology behind it. From tracking expert to developer who bridges both worlds.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- What sets me apart -->
      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-6">What Sets Me Apart</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          I combine technical performance, marketing performance and entrepreneurial performance in one person. That means: no communication gaps between development and marketing, no endless coordination rounds between departments. One person who understands the entire stack – from the first line of code to the final conversion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- My Approach -->
      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-6">My Approach</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary mt-1">-></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-text-primary">All-in-One:</strong>
              <span class="text-text-secondary"> Developer + Marketer + Analyst in one person. No interface losses.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary mt-1">-></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-text-primary">Agency Experience Without Overhead:</strong>
              <span class="text-text-secondary"> No account managers, no unnecessary processes, no bloated budgets.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary mt-1">-></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-text-primary">Value-Driven Work:</strong>
              <span class="text-text-secondary"> Fair price, no excess profit. Only selling what is actually needed.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-primary mt-1">-></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-text-primary">Self-Sustaining Rather Than Profit-Maximized:</strong>
              <span class="text-text-secondary"> Sustainability over growth at any price. Quality over quantity.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Values -->
      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-6">Values</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Direct</h4>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Speak clearly, without sugarcoating. Honest assessment instead of sales talk.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Transparent</h4>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Prices understandable, services honestly assessed. No hidden costs.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Self-Critical</h4>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Know your own limits and stand by them. Say "no" when something doesn't make sense.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Value-Driven</h4>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Don't sell products that aren't needed. Fair price instead of maximum price.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="reveal text-center p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-4">Let's Get to Know Each Other</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6">No sales pitch. Just an honest conversation.</p>
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="inline-block py-3 px-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-spectrum-pink text-white font-semibold hover:brightness-110 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-primary/25">
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>